  "description": "In the mood for a scare? You've come to the right place. Welcome to a world of nightmares and terror, created by the masters of horror at LINE Webtoon. Enter at your own risk.\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)\n\nStories featured:\n1) **Research** (HWANG Joon-Ho/YEON Je-Won)\n2) **Lovers** (HWANG Joon-Ho)\n3) **The Profile** (Lee Seung Chan)\n4) **The Maze** (TGM/Linda)\n5) **Ok-su Station Ghost** (HORANG)\n6) **The Spider and The Mantis** (KIM Eun-hyo/KIM Yeong-ji)\n7) **The Nightmare** (ImInSu/SONG Rae-hyeon)\n8) **A Bathroom Tale** (Hwang Youngchan)\n9-10) **The Moon Below** (Yuria)\n11) **First Acquaintances** (Lee Seung Chan)\n12) **The Visitor** (Mirchi)\n13) **Insomnia** (Go Ara/YEON Je-Won)\n14) **04 : 44** (CHOI Yoon-Jin)\n15) **A Summer Ghost** (SIU/Kang Im)\n16-17) **Tatoo** (YU Sang-Mo)\n18-19) **A Tale of Cat and Mouse** (Hye Jin Yang)\n20) **Bongcheon-Dong Ghost** (HORANG)\n21) **How to see a ghost** (Lee Seung Chan)\n22) **Mosquitoes** (HWANG Joon-Ho)\n23) **At Our House** (Sael Bi)\n24-25) **Beneath the Glass** (Jude Friday)\n26) **The Author** (YEON Je-Won)\n27) **A Ghost Photograph** (Oh Chang-ho)\n28) **The Guest House** (Radiya)\n29) **Author Extermination** (Kkomabi) \n\n*Note: The original published version on Naver contains 29 chapters. The WEBTOON version contains 23 chapters as some were not officially translated for English release.*",
